{"version":1,"content":"<p>圍繞人工智能（AI）的爭議令一些企業被迫按下了IPO暫停鍵，在Anthropic上市一天天迫近之際，數十億美元資金和長達數月的籌備工作陷入停頓。Truist Financial股票資本市場主管West Riggs表示：「一切好像癱瘓了似的。市場必須先理清頭緒。」</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1583420.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-10-22T17:20:36.674996+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":136,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-22T16:35:47+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-22T17:17:54.243018+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-22T17:17:54.243018+00:00","content_hash":"cd9dfb3f3a5a6ce28814bdccf3f7112f62beacafac517febcf931d955bd1c75d","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}